return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:55+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:55+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Yana matsar da laburaren kafofin watsa labarai na wannan shafin zuwa ma\'ajiyar abu ta Zinn® kuma yana ba da shi daga CDN. An saita shi daga allon kula ku na Zinn® - ba a taba buga mabudin shiga ba a cikin WordPress.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® bai dawo da wani alama ba. Ba a canza komai ba a kan wannan shafin.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil din daga wannan uwar garken ba, don haka ba a loda komai ba.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d). The file is still on this server.'=>'Maajiyar ta ki karɓar loda (HTTP %d). Fayil ɗin yana nan a kan wannan sabar.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Wannan shafin ba a haɗa shi da sauke kafofin watsa labarai na Zinn® ba kuma. Sabbin loda za su kasance a kan wannan uwar garken. Haɗa shi kuma daga allon kula na Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya bayar da martani tare da HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta cire haɗin.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da aka kafa, da yankuna, da sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da kiyaye kuɗin lafiya har sai bangarorin biyu sun yi farin ciki.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ka ɗauki ma\'aikatan da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko buga wani aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'Ba ka da izinin sarrafa wannan shafin.','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, turn on media offload for this site, and paste the pairing code it shows you. No access key is needed — this site never holds one.'=>'Buɗe allon kula na Zinn Digital®, kunna fitar da kafofin watsa labarai na wannan shafin, kumaliƙa lambar haɗin da ta nuna muku. Ba a buƙatar madanni damawa — wannan shafin baya riƙe da shi ko da ya sau ɗaya.','Pairing code'=>'Lambar haɗawa','Connect this site'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin','Status'=>'Matsayi','Connected to your Zinn Digital® account'=>'Haɗa zuwa ga asusunka na Zinn Digital®','Media served from'=>'Ana fitar da kafofin watsa labarai daga','This server (offloaded copies are being kept, but not served yet)'=>'Wannan sabar (ana adana kwafi amma ba a ba da su ba tukuna)','Local copies'=>'Kofe na gida','Removed once every size has uploaded'=>'An cire da zarar kowane girman ya loda','Kept on this server'=>'An adana a wannan uwar garken','Offloaded so far'=>'An cire kawo yanzu','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'%1$s fayiloli, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Har yanzu a kan wannan uwar garken','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s na %2$s abubuwan da aka makala','Older media moves in the background, a few files an hour, and picks up where it left off. Nothing is deleted from this server unless your dashboard says so.'=>'Tsoffin kafofin watsa labarai suna motsawa a baya, fayiloli kaɗan a ɗaya sa\'a, kuma suna ci gaba daga inda suka tsaya. Ba a goge komai daga wannan sabar sai dai idan dashboard ɗinku ya faɗi haka.','Last problem'=>'Matsala ta ƙarshe','Disconnect this site'=>'Cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Sabbin abubuwan da aka loda za su zauna a kan wannan sabar. Watsa labarai da aka riga aka matsar za su ci gaba da aiki - adireshinsu ba ya canzawa.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Sanya lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafa ku na Zinn Digital®.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'An haɗa. Sabbin abubuwan da aka loda za a adana su tare da Zinn Digital® tun daga yanzu, kuma kafofin watsa labarai na yanzu za su motsa a baya.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'An cire haɗi. Kafofin watsa labarai da aka riga aka matsar na ci gaba da aiki; sabbin abubuwan da aka loda suna zaune a kan wannan sabar.']];